@startuml Sequence_01_Auth_Radar
!theme plain
autonumber "<b>[00]</b>"
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif

skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #15885a
    ActorBorderColor #15885a
    LifeLineBorderColor #2E7D32
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #E8F5E9
    ParticipantBorderColor #15885a
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #F1F8E9
    ParticipantFontColor #1b5e20
    ParticipantFontStyle bold
    BoxBackgroundColor #FAFAFA
    BoxBorderColor #BDBDBD
}

header EMSICollab — Module Sécurité & Profil
title **Diagramme de Séquence 1 : Authentification JWT, Profilage & Radar de Compétences**
footer Cycle d'Ingénierie Logicielle — EMSI 2026-2027

actor "🎓 Étudiant" as Etu #E8F5E9
box "Front-End Client (:5173)" #FFFFFF
    participant "💻 Frontend React\n(Vite / Tailwind)" as Front #E8F5E9
end box

box "Passerelle & Sécurité (:8080 / :8081)" #F9FBE7
    participant "🚪 API Gateway\n(Spring Cloud Gateway)" as Gateway #E0F2F1
    participant "🔐 auth-service\n(Spring Boot 3 / JJWT)" as AuthSvc #E0F2F1
end box

box "Persistance (:5431)" #EDE7F6
    database "🗄️ PostgreSQL\n(auth_db)" as AuthDB #D1C4E9
end box

== 1. Authentification & Génération du Token JWT ==

Etu -> Front : Saisit email institutionnel (@emsi-edu.ma) et mot de passe
activate Front
Front -> Gateway : POST /api/v1/auth/login\nPayload: { email, password }
activate Gateway

Gateway -> AuthSvc : Reroute requête /api/v1/auth/login
activate AuthSvc

AuthSvc -> AuthDB : SELECT * FROM users WHERE email = ?
activate AuthDB
AuthDB --> AuthSvc : Tuple User (id, password_hash, role='STUDENT')
deactivate AuthDB

AuthSvc -> AuthSvc : Vérification cryptographique : BCrypt.checkpw(password, hash)

alt Identifiants valides et domaine @emsi-edu.ma conforme
    AuthSvc -> AuthSvc : Génère token JWT signé (HMAC-SHA256, expiration: 24h, claims: id, email, role)
    AuthSvc --> Gateway : 200 OK { token, user: { id, email, role: 'STUDENT', firstName, lastName } }
    Gateway --> Front : 200 OK (JWT Token + Profil)
    Front -> Front : Stocke JWT dans AuthContext et localStorage
    Front -> Front : Configure intercepteur Axios (Authorization: Bearer <token>)
else Identifiants erronés ou compte inactif
    AuthSvc --> Gateway : 401 Unauthorized (BadCredentialsException)
    Gateway --> Front : 401 Unauthorized
    Front --> Etu : Affiche alerte : "Identifiants invalides ou domaine non autorisé"
end

== 2. Chargement du Profil Technique & Radar de Compétences ==

Front -> Gateway : GET /api/v1/users/me (Bearer JWT)
Gateway -> Gateway : Filtre JwtAuthenticationFilter :\nValide signature, extrait X-User-Id, X-User-Role
Gateway -> AuthSvc : GET /api/v1/users/me\nHeaders: [X-User-Id, X-User-Role='STUDENT']

AuthSvc -> AuthDB : SELECT s.name, s.category, us.proficiency_level, us.years_of_experience\nFROM user_skills us JOIN skills s ON us.skill_id = s.id\nWHERE us.user_id = ?
activate AuthDB
AuthDB --> AuthSvc : Matrice de compétences (ex: Java: 5, React: 4, Docker: 3, SQL: 4)
deactivate AuthDB

AuthSvc --> Gateway : 200 OK (UserDto avec compétences détaillées)
deactivate AuthSvc
Gateway --> Front : 200 OK (UserDto)
deactivate Gateway

Front -> Front : Traitement graphique : instancie les axes du Radar Chart
Front --> Etu : Restitution visuelle du Dashboard & Radar d'expertise interactive
deactivate Front

@enduml